sf3jswing-jxakernel (1.1.5-04) stable; urgency=low
  
  * Console
    Strinbuilder replaces StringBuffer according to guide : http://download.oracle.com/javase/1.5.0/docs/guide/performance/speed.html
  * JXAenvUtils
    update JMF.properties storage in java.class.path from user.home
  * SpritesCacheManager
    Switched to WeakReference for better performance and heap memory usage management
    buffered I/O operations (64k)
    Heap memory
  * ThreadWorks 
    doLater and DoAndWait tasks can be run on memorySensitive caches (OutOfMemoryError protection)

