sf3jswing-jxakernel (1.1.1-11) stable; urgency=low

  * JFCApplet
    parses the antargs parameter String for setting system properties when the jvm_arguments is not read (<= Java 1.5 Plugin)
  * JFCAppletApp and JFCFrameApp (src/Mac)
    moved to net.sf.jiga.xtended.kernel package because of a conflict with the external jxa package
  * ExtensionsInstaller + build-jars.xml
    jxa/extensions.properties moved to net/sf/jiga/xtended/kernel/extensions.properties
    on Mac Systems, a reboot of Safari is attempted after extensions install (usually on Java 1.5 plugin).
    See properties/Mac/all/net/sf/jiga/xtended/kernel/restartSafari.applescript.
  * JXAenvUtils
    new env._ARCH enum properties
    exit thread issue
  * SpritesCacheManager
    compress mode, fixed bug
    writeSwap invoked before adding to cache
    public static void _cleanFileSwap() : cleans up the file swapping directory.
     CAUTION : this method IMMEDIATELY deletes all files located in the swapping directory. all cache instances that use the same directory may fail to recover after using this method.
     {@link #clearMemorySwap() use clearMemorySwap()} to safely delete all files used by this cache instance.
     @throws Exception if a file is not found
  * UIMessage
    new Icons

